            <ArticleTitle>Helplessness and power in health care.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>327-30</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Doctors, by virtue of their knowledge, are often in a position to exercise power over their patients. The authors, considering that some doctors seek to abuse this power, reflect on the nature and ethics of medical treatment.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
